# The batch scripts are run by cmd.exe, which misparses a file with LF-only
# line endings (a ")" on its own line can end the wrong block, and a
# multi-line command gets split).  Pin them to CRLF in the repository so
# they work on a fresh clone whatever the machine's autocrlf setting is.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Everything else stays as it is written.
* text=auto
